{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜で握手会でした(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれたみんなありがとうね❤️\nただこの日体調微妙だったからちょっと会話に遅れが出てたりしたかもだけど許してください"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/09/25/6804925/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪自分で焦がしちゃったもんだから（ストレートアイロンで）まーたオンザ眉毛になってしまいました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんとやっちまったよね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/09/25/6804925/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ワンピースはEMODA"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そうそう、来月わたし誕生日らしい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"21歳になるらしい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はぁ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"特になにも変わらないんだろうけど不安な気持ちでいっぱいになるのは何故。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんかあみももう大人なんだね、立派な。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張らなくちゃいけないよね、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"落ち着いた佇まいとか...\n色気...とかさ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここらで欲しいよそろそろ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみより3個年下のひなちまの色気が最近増しすぎてなんだか眩しくて直視出来ないんですよ、笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/09/25/6804925/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんと前髪焦がしてる場合じゃないよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、最近の出来事！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハムスター飼いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンガリアンハムスター。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"名前は牛若丸"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2015/09/25/6804925/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"可愛いだろーー❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でもあみよりも先にマザーの方に懐いてきてるんですよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"悔しい実に悔しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早く手乗りしてほしいのにどうしてもジィジィ鳴かれてしまう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンガリアンハムスター飼ったことある実績の持ち主はいろいろアドバイスよろしくお願いします。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(-_-)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ、サボテンに水あげなきゃ。"}],"source":"archive"}